23:["$","$L2c",null,{"world":"world","title":"ACTTOLOG World Hub","titleNe":"एक्टोलग वर्ल्ड हब","subtitle":"The ACTTOLOG world hub in 360° — every division connected by light: research, academy, games, darkroom and the AI core.","accent":"var(--vi)","earthLink":"/explore?mode=earth"}]
24:["$","section",null,{"className":"sec pt-2","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"wrap","children":[["$","$L21",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"sechead","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"secnum mb-3","children":["01"," · ","OUR STORY"]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"h2 max-w-[26ch]","children":["Acttolog began as a single question: why are research suppor…","$undefined"]}],"$undefined"]}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","$L21",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr]","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"prose !text-[15px]","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Acttolog began as a single question: why are research support, learning, creative media, useful tools and new digital opportunities scattered across so many disconnected places? Acttolog is the answer being built — one connected world where each division supports the others. Research informs the Academy, the Academy feeds creativity, creativity produces media and games, and Darkroom keeps the whole world supplied with verified tools and resources.\n\nActtolog is global from launch: English and नेपाली, NPR and USD, resources for Nepal and for international users. Nothing here invents a founding date, founder biography, awards, clients, investors or partnerships — the story grows as the ecosystem grows, and every word is editable in the CMS."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"dim !text-[13.4px]","children":"Acttolog एउटै प्रश्नबाट सुरु भयो: अनुसन्धान सहयोग, सिकाइ, सिर्जनशील मिडिया, उपयोगी औजार र नयाँ डिजिटल अवसरहरू किन यति धेरै छुट्टाछुट्टै ठाउँमा छरिएका छन्? Acttolog त्यसको उत्तर हो — एउटा जोडिएको संसार जहाँ प्रत्येक विभागले अर्कोलाई सहयोग गर्छ। अनुसन्धानले एकेडेमीलाई दिशा दिन्छ, एकेडेमीले सिर्जनशीलता जन्माउँछ, सिर्जनशीलताले मिडिया र खेल बनाउँछ, र डार्करूमले सम्पूर्ण संसारलाई प्रमाणित औजारले भरिरहन्छ।\n\nActtolog सुरुवातदेखि नै विश्वव्यापी छ: अङ्ग्रेजी र नेपाली, रु र USD, नेपाल र अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय दुवैका लागि स्रोतहरू।"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"panel self-start p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"eyebrow mb-4","children":"RESPONSIBLE TECHNOLOGY"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mut text-[13px] leading-relaxed","children":"Acttolog avoids absolute guarantees, hides nothing behind fake popularity numbers, labels paid placement clearly if it is ever enabled, keeps user profiles private by default, separates analytics from identity, and never presents external information as Acttolog content."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"dim mt-3 text-[12.2px] leading-relaxed","children":"Acttolog अतिरञ्जित ग्यारेन्टी गर्दैन, नक्कली लोकप्रियता देखाउँदैन, प्रायोजित सामग्री खुलेमा स्पष्ट लेबल लगाउँछ, प्रयोगकर्ता प्रोफाइल निजी राख्छ, एनालिटिक्स र पहिचान छुट्टाउँछ, र बाहिरी जानकारीलाई Acttolog सामग्री भनेर देखाउँदैन।"}]]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-16","children":[["$","$L21",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"sechead","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"secnum mb-3","children":["02"," · ","FOUNDATION"]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"h2 max-w-[26ch]","children":["Purpose, vision and mission","$undefined"]}],"$undefined"]}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","$L21","Purpose",{"delay":0,"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"card h-full p-7","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mono mb-3 text-[10.5px] tracking-[.24em]","style":{"color":"var(--cy)"},"children":"PURPOSE"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mut text-[13.4px] leading-relaxed","children":"Acttolog is a digital ecosystem that connects technology, research, education, entertainment, creativity, useful resources, and emerging digital opportunities in one connected world."}]]}]}],["$","$L21","Vision",{"delay":70,"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"card h-full p-7","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mono mb-3 text-[10.5px] tracking-[.24em]","style":{"color":"var(--vi)"},"children":"VISION"}],"$L2d"]}]}],"$L2e"]}]]}],"$L2f","$L30","$L31"]}]}]
